      "writtenOn": "2026-08-26T07:50:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We do have the addresses, specifically in `variables.CLUSTER_MEMBER_IPS`.\nIf I understand things correctly, what we don\u0027t have is mapping from what ODL reports to those addresses (get-entities names the owner as member-2, and kill_member/start_member take member numbers).\n\nInlining it means writing CLUSTER_MEMBER_IPS[owner - 1] at every call site and repeating the off-by-one. The original Robot solves it in the same way with Return_Member_IP over an index→IP dict.\nObviously, happy to inline it if you\u0027d rather.",
