      "writtenOn": "2026-08-26T07:50:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This was a deliberate decision since it matches the original.\n\nThe case is Find_And_Shutdown_Device_Entity_Owner -\u003e the owner failing. A \"graceful\" bin/stop lets ODL give up the entity ownership and close the device session while doing so; so the re-election path wouldn\u0027t be exercised in the same way. \n\nObviously, I am happy to add a stop_member next to it when some suite needs a graceful shutdown.",
